{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "2d52f4692823a7db7b2083491021872bc69836e138761a74d6d7dac504232dbd", "ja": "朋花の主張", "zh": "朋花的主张", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "79663f334663db4dcbc1ed591fe33a534ec665688ab7c3d6297f191114ffc43a", "ja": "朋花とのミーティング。希望のステージ案は\nセトリの半分以上が彼女のソロ曲、しかも\n最後は子豚ちゃん達と記念撮影という、実質\n朋花の主演公演だった。負担も尋常ではなく\nなるが、ともかく覚悟は受け取った！", "zh": "与朋花的会议。她提出的舞台方案是：\n歌单中超过一半是她的独唱曲，而且\n最后还要与小猪们合影留念，实质上\n就是一场以朋花为主角的演出。负担也将\n远超寻常，但不管怎样，她的决心已经收到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "9b8f6d5d58b5ee83019ef63be6e4be263063e25e644680b734f704f75a527df3", "ja": "朋花とのミーティング……", "zh": "与朋花的会面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "9f04d5bf51aed31670e49235caf29532a3567bd4a7c0b45d065f01f92ff65c64", "ja": "聖母の愛をいかに子豚ちゃん達に届けるか、\nまずこれを念頭に置かなくてはいけません～。", "zh": "首先必须牢记，怎样才能把圣母的爱传达给小猪们～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "b300507f7e1270aee35096479d582747ebedf2bfbdf18612f4ce21bc6285abc2", "ja": "なるほど、子豚ちゃん達に……。", "zh": "原来如此，要传达给小猪们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "dd7b93b9529a5aead43bf41f01779cdd5ceb1777bedfd3744593cd07e9ce74a0", "ja": "今回の公演では、私にアイディアがあります。", "zh": "这次的演出，我有一个主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "c3e0b62ec3753a0021df8dcd2e04b92259fcfcc95cd9617d62945745f0b73b37", "ja": "公演の後、私が子豚ちゃん達と一緒に聖画に\n収まってあげる、というのはどうでしょう～？", "zh": "演出结束后，由我和小猪崽们一起入画，怎么样～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "410eca783151c8d6d2c03b48daa821e94a2c6dc9a9201c928fa09b4f81dea0c4", "ja": "うん？　聖画？", "zh": "嗯？圣画？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "740805fb64ff4ef5245e1e8c58ffea28410c85c20f68d0b82c83313d0fcf15c4", "ja": "子豚ちゃん達には、聖母と共に映るまたとない機会。\nエントランスぐらい広い場所なら可能なはずです～。", "zh": "对小猪仔们来说，这是与圣母一同入镜的千载难逢的良机。\n只要是入口大厅那样宽敞的地方，就一定能办到呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "094eb5b80e353795f4d1b9168e7211496143960f1cdde8b4512c80e166a6a4c4", "ja": "あ、写真撮影！\nライブの後に撮影会をするってことだな？", "zh": "啊，拍照！\n也就是说，要在演唱会结束后举办摄影会，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "ec1107d304ef470fe22297fe8d70dff2bad4acbe7a9836b779dec3e52e1ace5f", "ja": "以前のサイン会も、子豚ちゃん達は大喜びしてくれまし\nた。今回は天にも昇る気持ちになることでしょう～。", "zh": "之前的签名会，小猪们也都开心极了。想必这次也会高兴得如登仙境吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "ce7289901d71e4345b1e9541858981d95b5c1372794691f04087f2fc745c443c", "ja": "なるほど。Team1stのインストアライブ＆サイン会、\nすごく盛り上がったよな……。", "zh": "原来如此。Team1st的店内演出和签名会，气氛非常热烈啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "95c242aa3ab6e8441104dbb276a66cb233573af6dae31c28334dfaf63bac5c92", "ja": "あれで最高のスタートダッシュになった。今回はそれを\nパワーアップさせて撮影会……うん、アリだと思う！", "zh": "那次活动让我们有了最棒的开场。这次再加上拍摄会，让它更上一层楼……嗯，我觉得可行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "9b09bd6ee6ccb50abb84b3e813fcf11ed61f98e6a7d283a5c043c91646f85eab", "ja": "子豚ちゃん達に届ける慈愛は、より深く大きく……。\n聖母として当然の務めです～。", "zh": "传递给小猪仔们的慈爱，要更深更广才行……\n这是作为圣母理所应当的职责～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "1cc324b7e80fc752beb14b1a8ce15ae74fcf1181fd04ada1d42650f6303bb450", "ja": "そういうことを踏まえると、セットリストも当然、\n先ほどお送りしたような形になりますよね～？", "zh": "考虑到这些，演出曲目表当然也会变成刚才发给您的那种形式，对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "b3e6d08c22abf85eee0980c7e86b854f47e949adc96532ed4dc89ba56a2d1844", "ja": "ん？　あ、さっきメッセージで希望を送って\nもらったんだっけ。え～っと、どれどれ……。", "zh": "嗯？啊，我记得刚才让你通过消息发过希望来着。呃～我看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "a044bdf06a4b44988248f8540cbec80843d90753277a367d6549aff430822d7a", "ja": "え？　……あれ？　朋花、これ……\n朋花のソロステージが半分くらいあるんだけど……。", "zh": "咦？……哎呀？朋花，这个……\n好像有一半左右都是朋花的个人舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "f8ed6268ffa4fd1137217e5655abe177f49e0322d3d3bc02b29db6001cacbe85", "ja": "あら、半分より少し多いはずですよ～♪", "zh": "哎呀，应该比一半还要再多一点哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "6bc8844da6923766ec38029fae2db4ccec0e51a8ddbda224e95f22d0af22ec00", "ja": "しかも最後は3曲連続ソロで出ずっぱり……。\nこれ、なんか朋花の主演公演みたいなんだけど……？", "zh": "而且最后还要连续独唱3首曲子，一直不下台……这简直像是朋花的主演公演了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "562dbaf26408f5af1e25efdee044aa1eb785557eaca76ba25f9235837c6ba1d1", "ja": "みたい、ではありません。\n私の希望は聖母の主演公演そのものです～。うふふ♪", "zh": "不是“像”，\n我希望的本来就是圣母的主演公演哦～。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "14c39e6b5e734801aa38a86c78b4f3b7a3a8ae0215b8422e0380eb868f647db2", "ja": "な、なんで！？　ていうか、これじゃ朋花の負担がすご\nいことになるぞ？　撮影会もやるなら、なおさら……。", "zh": "为、为什么！？话说回来，这样一来朋花的负担会变得非常\n重吧？要是还要举办摄影会，那就更是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "2a4460281481165414b9cfe06809c96f9b6fb79d905d4915c36d91b8bd841191", "ja": "安心してください、聖母に不可能はありません♪\n……それに。", "zh": "请放心，圣母是无所不能的♪\n……而且。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "5a40b2bda3184e45fb34a644748200f6983b065e7b4a4513cfef36b06134d07e", "ja": "この程度の覚悟も示せないようでは、\nお二人に笑われてしまいますから。", "zh": "如果连这点觉悟都无法展现出来，可是会被两位笑话的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "43bccb9ec8fed2d5c1db8392abc8aba6608f1dd7f6ad63091a309cdda0c3a42d", "ja": "え？　朋花……？", "zh": "咦？朋花……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "5698da2dc57bc487f4656fb59d70f414dd93d5c2714b9c30b33b0231d8b476c8", "ja": "（そっか。美也とまつりから刺激を受けてるんだな。\nそれで敢えて、自分から前に……）", "zh": "（原来如此。她是受到了美也和茉莉的刺激啊。所以才会特意主动往前走……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "8809395c36249a1116fa493e6bfdfc37d6fc8e9eb9c10846645436d7c69b929e", "ja": "まして、聖母を笑いものにするなど、\n絶対に許されませんからね～？", "zh": "更何况，把圣母当成笑柄，更是绝对不可原谅的哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "f3dd156c3585a826519e5ee16efc71754dbdc9642524f872340f2ecc6637bbc2", "ja": "えっ！？　……あ、いや、あれは戯れというか、\n親しみの表れ、みたいなものじゃないか？", "zh": "诶！？……啊，不，那算是开个玩笑，或者说，是亲近的表现之类的，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "680cf282a89554f5663327f1f73f250ef7d95fca3062159710ce111096757a09", "ja": "あれとは何ですか？\n私は誰のこととも言っていませんよ～？", "zh": "“那个”是指什么呢？\n我又没说到底是谁哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "dc2b1e6b6dd2a755c926c3660dc797d7e778eddee0348fde252fa14178b715a3", "ja": "そ、そうだな言ってない！\nあ、俺も誰とも言ってないけどな！？", "zh": "对、对啊，没说过！\n啊，我也没说是谁啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "3a827c345727536e6aeebc29cc41e97f542088d87bf4007256f14a3f3c08c7d1", "ja": "……こほん。とにかくわかった。\n朋花の希望セトリは確かに受け取ったよ。", "zh": "……咳咳。总之我明白了。\n朋花希望的演出曲目，我确实收到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "a6fd51357c506c3572ae97928e5281123d97b7bcc947286922c346f57354e8df", "ja": "あら、いいんですか？\nこんなに偏った希望を受け取ってしまって。", "zh": "哎呀，这样好吗？\n把这么偏心的愿望给收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "5f0fa3961b52de7fbadf3c99ee0711fdce1f33816d8956548d3afc066fd182d2", "ja": "朋花の気持ちが伝わってきたから。\nあとの調整は、俺の役目だ！", "zh": "因为我感受到了朋花的心意。\n剩下的调整，就是我的职责了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_02_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "378a9a88b821e94b6a6b1534954fea9beb9c1e543dc1af3d37ce668c25a3ef04", "ja": "そうですか……ふふっ。\nでは、その言葉通り、頑張ってくださいね～♪", "zh": "这样啊……呵呵。\n那么，就请按照您说的，加油吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
